THAT Council take no action with respect to this application to rezone 728
        Massie Drive and 2746 Dinan Place under Bylaw No. 2097 until such time as the
        following items are addressed and reviewed by the Sustainable Development
        Advisory Committee:

            a. Substantial completion of the proposed development concept, including
               the commercial opportunities;

            b. Surface parking for any commercial opportunities;

            c. Water table depth;

            d. Bicycle parking and alternative transportation opportunities; and

            e. Early Guidance Guidelines for development be utilized.

